/// Unified line diffs, for reporting what drifted rather than only that something did.
//
// Buzz declarations for the diff host module: the object mirrors its methods
// return, then one `export extern fun` per method. Registered with SetModuleDecls
// beside the native implementation, so the checker reads the signature while the
